{
  "_comment": [
    "Default bindings for 4D Sports Boxing: the mouse as the game's mouse (its buttons, and its place over the picture as",
    "the two axes), and the PC's keyboard as the game reads it - the numeric keypad (the arrows, Home, PgUp, End and PgDn",
    "too) for the human boxer's default controls with Enter and the right Shift its punch buttons, the letters and digits",
    "themselves, Esc, Tab, Ctrl and Alt. A default setup sends either Shift as Shift: it is the right Shift here, the",
    "second set's button; capitals come with either. Some of these are also Chimera's own keys (F1-F10 the savestate",
    "slots, R and Shift+R); Chimera's take precedence while its hotkeys are bound."
  ],
  "AllTrollers": {
    "4D Sports Boxing": {
      "Mouse Left": "WMouse L",
      "Mouse Right": "WMouse R",
      "Keypad 8": "Keypad8, Up",
      "Keypad 2": "Keypad2, Down",
      "Keypad 4": "Keypad4, Left",
      "Keypad 6": "Keypad6, Right",
      "Keypad 7": "Keypad7, Home",
      "Keypad 9": "Keypad9, PageUp",
      "Keypad 1": "Keypad1, End",
      "Keypad 3": "Keypad3, PageDown",
      "Keypad 5": "Keypad5",
